ches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T10:21:52.647Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"361320","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/361320/","officialWebsite":"http://www.alternativesoft.co.uk/classics/classics.html","support":null},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":2,"unit":"GB","display":"2 GB","approximateBytes":2000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 2 GB"},"recommended":{"value":2,"unit":"GB","display":"2 GB","approximateBytes":2000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 2 GB"}},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"unknown","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player"]},"genres":["Simulation","Strategy"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"361320","steamName":"Casino Inc.","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/361320/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:04:29.394781+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Classic strategy game from 2003. Run your own casino in the 1970s. It's classy. It's glitzy. It's all yours. Take a gamble. Start small with a slot machine or two. Employ some staff. People will be talking about your place from coast to coast. Includes The Management Expansion Pack.","detailedDescription":"For Windows XP, Vista and 7 (This game will not run on Windows 8)\n\nNow includes The Management Expansion Pack!\nAdditional Casinos, cities, attractions, employees and much more.\n\nClassic strategy game from 2003.  Run your own casino in the 1970s. It's classy. It's glitzy. It's all yours. Take a gamble. Start small with a slot machine or two. Employ some staff and open the doors. Pretty soon people will be talking about your place from coast to coast.\n\nVisitor profiles vary from wealthy businessmen, professional gamblers to trailer trash and holiday flutterers. All have tastes to suit their budget and style. Teenagers seek noisy arcade machines, and high rollers want big stakes and big returns. They all have one thing in common: cash to spend.\n\nAs you grow to own hotels and casinos you'll want to set the amount of floor space given to rooms, bar and restaurant areas, roulette, card tables, slot machines, entertainment lounges, and to also set the level of payouts, profits and cream offs on the tables and machines. You will be able to see, in high detail, which of your outfits are popular. The graphical scale allows you to track the ebb and flow of the city at a zoomed out perspective, but then to zoom inside your buildings to see the gamblers playing Black Jack at the tables.\n\nYou can actively encourage the growth of the city by your actions. This is a tourist town; it has a multitude of businesses that very visibly attract customers if popular; the airport and roads become busy. The streets get choked. The tills ring more frequently. And, provided you're taking care of business, the profits will roll in.\nKey Features\n\n• Casino, Inc. features three fictitious cities; Little Hope Springs, Fortune Falls and Chancersville\n\n• There are over 120 different characters in the game\n\n• There are over 50 attractions you can buy for your Casinos\n\n• Build 1 to 5 star hotel accommodation\n\n• Set up Limos and Shuttle Bus services\n\n• Damage your rivals by starting fights, spiking drinks and shooting people!!\n\n• Making money has never been so much fun!\n\nNow also includes The Management expansion pack.\nAdditional Casinos, cities, attractions, employees and much more.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/361320/header.jpg?t=1564676161"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/361320/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1564676161"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/361320/extras/2506956007081deefb94e34a10063160.avif?t=1564676161","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/361320/extras/b755101f96e4acbfb6e86936dcba1eba.avif?t=1564676161","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/361320/extras/600eab42227d43623154b43a68094641.avif?t=1564676161","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/361320/extras/0348e680e8f84de26ffeff8d79dbcd89.avif?t=1564676161","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/361320/extras/71ca763d4eec00ac1814928f9f268898.avif?t=1564676161","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/361320/extras/0fae511294f57d9e74d617024a2c8cde.avif?t=1564676161","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/361320/ss_d66c389237e2e97b02b9a3060b1a401b7b475318.600x338.jpg?t=1564676161","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/361320/ss_d66c389237e2e97b02b9a3060b1a401b7b475318.1920x1080.jpg?t=15646